{"created": "2026-10-25T20:33:56.818196+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-25T20:33:57.033394+00:00", "id": 23511350, "conceptrecid": "23511349", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23511350", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23511349", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23511350", "metadata": {"title": "Decision-Free Algebraic Rejection for Post-Quantum Key Encapsulation: Replication Package", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23511350", "publication_date": "2026-10-25", "description": "<p>This record provides the replication materials for the study <strong>&ldquo;Decision-Free Algebraic Rejection for Post-Quantum Key Encapsulation&rdquo; (DFAR)</strong>.</p>\n<p>DFAR investigates an alternative to the conventional validity-controlled rejection path in Fujisaki&ndash;Okamoto-style key-encapsulation mechanisms. The construction replaces the ciphertext-consistency decision and conditional candidate-key selection with two keyed evaluations that cancel for self-consistent ciphertexts and produce a pseudorandom deformation otherwise.</p>\n<p>The package contains C implementations covering ML-KEM-512, ML-KEM-768, and ML-KEM-1024; an independent Go implementation for ML-KEM-768; native AArch64 validation material; controlled software-fault experiments; raw performance measurements; experimental protocols; environment records; analysis scripts; and verification procedures. It also includes the supplementary technical material and the proofs supporting the main security results.</p>\n<p>The primary x86-64 evaluation uses matched source-level implementations and paired complete-decapsulation measurements. The package retains the experimental records and scripts needed to examine the reported results, together with secondary implementation and diagnostic evidence.</p>\n<p>The security claims are subject to the assumptions and query models stated in the manuscript. The implementation is a research profile and is not presented as a bit-for-bit FIPS 203 replacement for inconsistent ciphertexts. The software-fault experiments do not establish immunity to arbitrary implementation faults.</p>\n<p><strong>Associated manuscript:</strong> Decision-Free Algebraic Rejection for Post-Quantum Key Encapsulation.</p>\n<p><strong>Replication entry point:</strong> <code>python3 run_verification_suite.py</code></p>\n<p>Additional reproduction instructions and environment requirements are provided in <code>REPLICATION_GUIDE.txt</code>.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Alsawalqah, Hamad", "affiliation": "The University of Jordan"}, {"name": "Abadleh, Ahmad", "affiliation": "Mutah University"}], "keywords": ["Post-quantum cryptography", "ML-KEM", "Key encapsulation mechanisms", "Fujisaki\u2013Okamoto transformation", "Implicit rejection", "Decision-Free Algebraic Rejection", "IND-CCA security", "Cryptographic implementation security", "Software fault testing", "Reproducible research"], "version": "V1.0.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23511349"}}]}}, "title": "Decision-Free Algebraic Rejection for Post-Quantum Key Encapsulation: Replication Package", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23511350", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23511350?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23511350", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23511350", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23511350", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511349", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23511349", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23511349", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23511349", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23511350/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23511350/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23511350/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-25T20:33:57.033394+00:00", "recid": "23511350", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "a20f784c-1b9d-4f28-8b08-8116b7a3740e", "key": "DFAR_Replication_Package_Final_Zenodo.zip", "size": 407114, "checksum": "md5:bcbdf663c698f3709e974efbad0604c0", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23511350/files/DFAR_Replication_Package_Final_Zenodo.zip/content"}}], "swh": {}, "owners": [{"id": "1822025"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 0, "unique_downloads": 0, "views": 1, "unique_views": 1, "version_downloads": 0, "version_unique_downloads": 0, "version_unique_views": 1, "version_views": 1}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}# ----
